# Copilot's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-copilot-setting-token = A GitHub token of the account with Copilot, e.g. a fine-grained personal access token from https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens with no extra permissions, or the output of `gh auth token`. Not needed when a Copilot editor plugin is signed in on the host.
usage-copilot-setting-enterprise-host = For GitHub Enterprise Cloud with data residency: the host, such as octocorp.ghe.com. Usage is then read from api.<host>.
